   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Two-speed protocol ★\n1. code calls get_logs + dt_search_logs (no LLM)\n2. code computes Δ err%, bands, resolution label\n3. Laya triage_service per service (~40 ms)\n4. conf ≥ τ and SEV-3/4 → raise_alert directly\n5. SEV-1/2 or conf < τ → Gemini 7-step loop (hints)\n6. call_on_call_engineer → Laya approve_page guard\n7. log probabilities + outcome → agent_runs",
   "originalText": "Two-speed protocol ★\n1. code calls get_logs + dt_search_logs (no LLM)\n2. code computes Δ err%, bands, resolution label\n3. Laya triage_service per service (~40 ms)\n4. conf ≥ τ and SEV-3/4 → raise_alert directly\n5. SEV-1/2 or conf < τ → Gemini 7-step loop (hints)\n6. call_on_call_engineer → Laya approve_page guard\n7. log probabilities + outcome → agent_runs",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "proto",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
