  {
   "id": "notes",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 560,
   "y": 2260,
   "width": 1174.5,
   "height": 112.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1942080813,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 119682499,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Laya answers bounded questions (severity, failure mode, page or not) with probabilities; Gemini still reasons and writes the report.\n2. Give it bands, not raw numbers: code turns 20.9% into \"high (15–30%)\". Thresholds and Δ math stay in code.\n3. Use only choice questions (severity = 4 options, page = A/B). Avoid score and noul; gate on confidence, never act_probability.\n4. Zero-shot Laya is near chance: train on the SEV scenarios + agent_runs history and fit temperatures before choosing τ.\n5. laya-serve defaults to :8000, which the mock app already uses, so run it on :8100.\n6. Keep the state small (bands + 3–5 error samples, not raw logs): the checkpoints read 512–1,024 tokens.",
   "originalText": "1. Laya answers bounded questions (severity, failure mode, page or not) with probabilities; Gemini still reasons and writes the report.\n2. Give it bands, not raw numbers: code turns 20.9% into \"high (15–30%)\". Thresholds and Δ math stay in code.\n3. Use only choice questions (severity = 4 options, page = A/B). Avoid score and noul; gate on confidence, never act_probability.\n4. Zero-shot Laya is near chance: train on the SEV scenarios + agent_runs history and fit temperatures before choosing τ.\n5. laya-serve defaults to :8000, which the mock app already uses, so run it on :8100.\n6. Keep the state small (bands + 3–5 error samples, not raw logs): the checkpoints read 512–1,024 tokens.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  }
 ],
